# **6.3.7 Conduct a mass vaccination campaign**

Collaborate with the national immunization and disease prevention control (IVD) program managers/directors to conduct a mass vaccination campaign, if indicated. Develop or update a micro-plan for the mass vaccination campaign as soon as possible. Speed is essential in an emergency vaccination because time is needed to obtain and distribute vaccines.

