Make sure that people handle food safely at home, in restaurants, at food vending settings and in factories. Refer to the established national standards and controls for the handling and processing of food.

To ensure food hygiene:

- (a) conduct community education on food hygiene practices for the general public and those in the food industry;
- (b) visit restaurants, food vendors, food packaging factories and other venues to inspect foodhandling practices, focusing on safe practices such as proper hand-washing, cleanliness and adherence to national standards;
