- (c) case-based reporting; refer to Section 2
- (d) routine reporting (weekly aggregates) and routine monthly reporting; refer to Section 2. Figure 9.1 below illustrates how information flows in eIDSR system;
- (e) outbreak/emergency management; refer to Sections 4 and 6; case investigation; refer to Section 6;
- (f) contact tracing; refer to Section 6;
